      "text": "Postpartum hemorrhage"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " is blood loss > 1000 mL, or blood loss with symptoms or signs of hypovolemia, within 24 hours after childbirth."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
